  "question": "Which two numbers should be interchanged to make the given equation correct?\n\n56 + 18 - 11 × 3 + 4 × (66 ÷ 2) + 22 = 151\n\n((Note: Interchange should be done of entire number and not individual digits of a given number.): Interchange should be done of entire number and not individual digits of a given number.)",
