  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 56 + 18 - 11 × 3 + 4 × (66 ÷ 2) + 22 = 151\n\nOption 1) 3 and 2 \n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 56 + 18 - 11 × 2 + 4 × (__**66 ÷**____** 3**__) + 22 = 151\n\n⇒ 56 + 18 - __**11 × 2**__ + __**4 × 22**__ + 22 = 151\n\n⇒ __**56 + 18**__ - 22 __**+ 88 + 22**__ = 151\n\n⇒ __**184 **____**- 22**__ = 151\n\n⇒ 162 ≠ 151\n\n**Option 2) 11 and 22**\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 56 + 18 - 22 × 3 + 4 × (__**66 ÷**____** 2**__) + 11 = 151\n\n⇒ 56 + 18 - __**22 × 3**__ + __**4 × 33**__ + 11 = 151\n\n⇒ __**56 + 18**__ - 66 __**+ 132 **____**+ 11**__ = 151\n\n⇒ __**217 - **____**66**__ = 151\n\n⇒ 151 = 151\n\nOption 3) 18 and 11\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 56 + 11 - 18 × 3 + 4 × (__**66 ÷ 2**__) + 22 = 151\n\n⇒ 56 + 11 - **__18 × 3 __**+ __**4 × 33**__ + 22 = 151\n\n⇒ __**56 + 11**__ - 54 __**+ 132**____** + 22**__ = 151\n\n⇒ __**221 - 54**__ = 151\n\n⇒ 167 ≠ 151\n\nOption 4) 56 and 66\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 66 + 18 - 11 × 3 + 4 × (**__56 ÷ 2__**) + 22 = 151\n\n⇒ 66 + 18 - __**11 × 3**__ + __**4 × 28**__ + 22 = 151\n\n⇒ __**66 + 18**__ - 33 __**+ 112 + 22**__ = 151\n\n​⇒ __**218 - 33**__ = 151\n\n​⇒ 185 ≠ 151\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"11 and 22\".\n\n6e",
